    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "We are delighted to present this wonderful opportunity to acquire a property with so much potential in the heart of Yeats Country, in beautiful North County Sligo. This three-bedroom, semi-detached cottage in Attiduff, Ballinfull, is set on an elevated 0.62 acre (0.25 hectare) site, enjoying lovely views across Sligo Bay towards Knocknarea Mountain.\r\nThe cottage is in need of renovation and presents an excellent opportunity for those seeking to refurbish and transform a traditional home in an attractive countryside setting. It offers considerable potential and may qualify for a range of available refurbishment and energy-efficiency grants, including the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, Derelict Property Grant and SEAI Home Energy Grants, subject to eligibility and the applicable terms and conditions."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch\r\n1.2m x 1.4m\r\n\r\nHallway\r\n2.0m x 1.0m\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n4.5m x 3.4m\r\nFireplace. Hot Press.\r\n\r\nBedroom No.1 / Sitting Room\r\nFireplace.\r\n4.6m x 3.0m\r\n\r\nBedroom No.2\r\n3.7m x 2.5m\r\n\r\nBedroom No.3\r\n2.5m x 2.0m\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\n3.6m x 2.3m\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n2.6m x 2.3m\r\n\r\nOutside Store"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "* May qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, Derelict Property Grant and SEAI Home Energy Grants, subject to eligibility and the applicable terms and conditions.\r\n* Oil Fired CH – requiring upgrade.\r\n* Mains water.\r\n* Private septic tank.\r\n* Block built out building.\r\n* High speed broadband available in area.\r\n* Large site with driveway & ample parking.\r\n* Location: Grange 5 km / Sligo 16 km / Streedagh Beach 7 km / Lissadell House 4 km"
      },
      {
